    "description": "<p><a href=\"\" title=\"https://bioimage.io/#/?id=ilastik/covid_if_training_data\">View on bioimage.io</a> # Covid-IF Training Data </p>\n<h1>Covid-IF Training Data</h1>\n<p>Training data for cell and nucleus segmentation as well as infected cell classification of Covid19 in immunofluorescence.\nThe images are taken with a high-throughput microscope and were used as training data to set up an IF based CoV19 antibody assay <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/bies.202000257\">here</a>.</p>",
